{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33551","headline":"冬杪归陵阳别业五首 五 · 许棠","name":"冬杪归陵阳别业五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"游秦复滞燕，不觉近衰年。\n旅貌同柴毁，行衣对骨穿。\n篱寒多啄雀，木落断浮烟。\n楚夜闻鸣鴈，犹疑在塞天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33551.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33551","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}